<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">01.485 Eight Over Seven Brilliant 96</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Strickland, R; Carss, W.; Thompson, G; TFG Newsletter, </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Oct 92, v13n4p26</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">April Fool's joke 1990 actually turned out OK</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">54 facets + 48 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">8-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.000  T/W = 0.538  U/W = 0.538</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.444 C/W = 0.168</tspan>
